glyph ($0..9)-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($0..9) 4 0
glyph ($1..4**10)($0..9)-circled
ref enclosing-circle-bg
ref ($1..4**10)-4x10 4 3
ref ($0..9)-4x10 9 3
glyph 50-circled
ref enclosing-circle-bg
ref 5-4x10 4 3
ref 0-4x10 9 3

map ⓪|①|②|③|④|⑤|⑥|⑦|⑧|⑨ = ($0..9)-circled
map ⑩|⑪|⑫|⑬|⑭|⑮|⑯|⑰|⑱|⑲ = 1($0..9)-circled
map ⑳|㉑|㉒|㉓|㉔|㉕|㉖|㉗|㉘|㉙ = 2($0..9)-circled
map ㉚|㉛|㉜|㉝|㉞|㉟|㊱|㊲|㊳|㊴ = 3($0..9)-circled
map ㊵|㊶|㊷|㊸|㊹|㊺|㊻|㊼|㊽|㊾ = 4($0..9)-circled
map ㊿ = 50-circled

glyph ($a-z)-upper-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($a-z)-upper 4 0

glyph ($a-z)-lower-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref ($a-z)-lower

map Ⓐ|Ⓑ|Ⓒ|Ⓓ|Ⓔ|Ⓕ|Ⓖ|Ⓗ|Ⓘ|Ⓙ|Ⓚ|Ⓛ|Ⓜ|Ⓝ|Ⓞ|Ⓟ|Ⓠ|Ⓡ|Ⓢ|Ⓣ|Ⓤ|Ⓥ|Ⓦ|Ⓧ|Ⓨ|Ⓩ = ($a-z)-upper-circled
map ⓐ|ⓑ|ⓒ|ⓓ|ⓔ|ⓕ|ⓖ|ⓗ|ⓘ|ⓙ|ⓚ|ⓛ|ⓜ|ⓝ|ⓞ|ⓟ|ⓠ|ⓡ|ⓢ|ⓣ|ⓤ|ⓥ|ⓦ|ⓧ|ⓨ|ⓩ = ($a-z)-lower-circled

glyph ($0..10)-circled-sm
ref enclosing-small-circle
ref ($0..10)-5x6 6 5
map 🄋|➀|➁|➂|➃|➄|➅|➆|➇|➈|➉ = ($0..10)-circled-sm

glyph hangul-($hangul-init-lex)-circled
ref enclosing-circle-sbg
ref hangul-($hangul-init-lex)-half 4 0
map ㉠|㉡|㉢|㉣|㉤|㉥|㉦|㉧|㉨|㉩|㉪|㉫|㉬|㉭ = hangul-($hangul-init-lex)-circled

glyph hangul-($hangul-init-lex)a-circled
ref enclosing-circle-bg
ref hangul-($hangul-init-lex)-half 3 0
ref hangul-a-half-narrow 8 0
map ㉮|㉯|㉰|㉱|㉲|㉳|㉴|㉵|㉶|㉷|㉸|㉹|㉺|㉻ = hangul-($hangul-init-lex)a-circled

glyph katakana-($kana-lex)-circled
ref enclosing-circle
ref katakana-($kana-lex)-half 4 0
map U+32D0..32FE = katakana-($kana-lex)-circled

